"Mound of Music" has been updated to version v.240903. The main updates are as follows:

1. The game mode selection has been re-optimized. Choosing Music Mode will directly start the music gameplay, while selecting Story Mode will take you into the game's narrative;
2. A new track, "Ride of the Valkyries," has been added as a special story track, and the display of the aircraft gameplay has been enhanced;
3. The exam gameplay has been optimized, with new tracks or musical instrument rewards available upon passing;
4. The music gameplay now includes tag identification and a new track collection feature;
5. The guidance for music gameplay and the content related to the devil's deal have been optimized;
6. Various bugs have been fixed.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44984583/d23125ef3d4ec045b6b5a7a0538ad488b300874a.png[/img]

Apart from the complete narrative, the above-mentioned features are also available in the Demo version for you to try out!
If you have played the old version and encountered save file issues, it is recommended to clean up the save directory:

C:\Users\[Your Username]\AppData\LocalLow\ElifGames\MoundofMusic
Try deleting the setting.save file or remove all contents within the folder to start anew.

If you have any questions, please feel free to contact the development team. Email: elifgamestudio@gmail.com

The game content will continue to be improved and enriched. Please add "Mound of Music" to your wishlist to support us, thank you everyone!

"Mound of Music" has been updated to version v.240823. The main updates are as follows:

1. Key binding adjustments have been re-optimized;
2. The UI for music-related gameplay has been re-optimized and adjusted;
3. The performance of music gameplay has been enhanced;
4. Localization content has been proofread and refined;
5. Various bugs have been fixed.

We appreciate your support and attention. The game content will continue to be improved and enriched.
